WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:03.470
In an old frail town, there was a gang of dirty guys.

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:05.470
They called the bathtub ring.

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:07.710
Their boss was Dirty Bert.

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:09.570
He'd plaster kids with dirt.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.010
He was having a real wild fling.

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:14.810
Mr. Bubble called him out, Dirty Bert.

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:17.590
and saw our hero swing.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:20.220
He got Bert roped and tied.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.420
He scrubbed Bert's dirty hide.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.080
And he cleaned up the bathtub ring.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.960
Take a bath with Mr. Bubble and give

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.320
dirty Bert a lot of trouble.
